<!--
  The "LENTA" wordmark. Deliberately without the ".RU" the source site's logo carries: this is an
  unofficial reader of that site's public RSS feeds, and reproducing its logo whole is both a
  trademark someone else owns and a claim to be the official app. Same reason the launcher label
  is "Lenta Reader" and not "Lenta.ru" (see values/strings.xml).

  The glyphs arrived as a single merged path in which every subpath chained its starting move off
  the previous subpath's end point, so the period, R and U could not simply be deleted without
  shifting everything after them. Each subpath here starts with an absolute M instead, which is
  why this file's path data looks different in shape from a typical exported vector but draws the
  same five glyphs. The viewport is cropped to the wordmark's real width (164 units, from 252)
  and the height is untouched, so nothing else that sizes against this drawable had to change.
-->
